  "type": "governance",
  "title": "One readings store feeds the scorecard and one ledger declares N/A cells",
  "statement": "A reading persisted by sense record MUST be visible to audit scorecard at the same head without any copy or rebuild step, a recorded reading MUST carry the declaring role and the human invocation, every N/A cell MUST come from the single ledger with a reason and lie inside the declared grid, and a cell whose readings are all skipped MUST be recorded as N/A with the declaration reason.",
  "rationale": "Articles 33 and 36 make the scorecard a state estimate over one evidence store; ADR-SCR-0001, ADR-SCR-0002, and ADR-SCR-0003 fix the store and the ledger.",
  "status": "active",
